otech】\nL56:     * 【42†Biopharma】\nL57:     * 【43†CDMO】\nL58:     * 【44†Lab Diagnostics】\nL59:     * 【45†Industrial and Applied Sciences】\nL60:   * 【46†New Products】\nL61:   * 【47†Promotions】\nL62:   * 【48†Contact Us】\nL63:   * 【49†Quick Order】\nL64:   * 【50†Order Status and Tracking】\nL65:   * 【51†Documents and Certificates】\nL66: \nL67: Search\nL68: \nL69: Search All\nL70: \nL71: [Input] [Input]\nL72: \nL73: Search\nL74: \nL75: [Input: Search by catalog number, product name, keyword, application] [Input]\nL76: \nL77: [Input]\nL78: \nL79: [Input]\nL80: \nL81:   * 【50†Order Status】\nL82:   * 【49†Quick Order】\nL83:   * 【52†Promos】\nL84:   * Sign in\nL85: \nL86: 【0†Sign in】\nL87: \nL88: Don't have an account ? 【1†Create Account】\nL89:     *     *     * 【53†Account】\nL90:     * 【50†Check Order Status】\nL91:     * 【54†Aspire Member Program】\nL92:     * 【55†Connect: Lab, Data, Apps†apps.thermofisher.com】\nL93:     * 【56†Custom Products & Projects】\nL94:     * 【57†Services Central†apps.thermofisher.com】\nL95: \nL96:   * 【58†Image: Oxoid&trade; Peptonised Milk】\nL97: \nL98: Thermo Scientific™\nL99: # Oxoid™ Peptonised Milk\nL100: \nL101: Oxoid Peptonised Milk is a pancreatic digest of high grade skimmed milk powder with high levels of carbohydrate and calcium.\nL102: \nL103: Catalog Number  | Quantity\nL104: --- | ---\nL105: LP0032J  | 250g\nL106: \nL107: Catalog number LP0032J\nL108: \nL109: Price (USD)\nL110: \nL111: -\nL112: \nL113: Request A Quote\nL114: \nL115: Quantity:\nL116: \nL117: 250g\nL118: \nL119: Oxoid Peptonised Milk is a pancreatic digest of high grade skimmed milk powder with high levels of carbohydrate and calcium.\nL120: \nL121:   * Particularly useful in media for bacteriological examination of dairy products\nL122: \nL123: Specifications\nL124: Description Peptonized milk\nL125: \nL126: Quantity 250g\nL127: \nL128: Form Powder\nL129: \nL130: Product Type Milk\nL131: \nL132: Unit Size Each\nL133: \nL134: Ordering\nL135: \nL136:   * 【50†Order Status】\nL1